  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Roughly chop cucumber and tomato.\n• In a small bowl, combine cucumber and yoghurt. Season and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e5d1fdd6d3e8af9dd0a9d3/step-c2071100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Remove pan from heat, add honey and sesame seeds and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e5d1fdd6d3e8af9dd0a9d3/step-afea5510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e5d1fdd6d3e8af9dd0a9d3/step-b5e52820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill tortillas with mixed salad leaves, honey-sesame haloumi, tomato and cucumber yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e5d1fdd6d3e8af9dd0a9d3/step-09a8bd30.jpg"
    }
  ]
